## solution

#### dynamic programming with memoization

```python
def can_concat(s, words):
  return _can_concat(s, words, {})

def _can_concat(s, words, memo):
  if s in memo:
    return memo[s]

  if s == '':
    return True

  for word in words:
    if s.startswith(word):
      suffix = s[len(word):]
      if _can_concat(suffix, words, memo) == True:
        memo[s] = True
        return True

  memo[s] = False
  return False
```

- s = length of string
- w = # of words
- Time: ~O(sw)
- Space: O(s)

